#    Classes
#################################################################

###  https://pid.vocab14224.org/Basic/Failure
<https://pid.vocab14224.org/Basic/Failure> owl:equivalentClass [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                 owl:onProperty :hasFailureMechanism ;
                                                                 owl:someValuesFrom <https://pid.vocab14224.org/Basic/FailureMechanism>
                                                               ] .

